rom F to Z still needs checking.\n\nI'm weighing a mixture over whether the two copies' computations coincide, and I'd put that fairly high since the setup is symmetric. Working through the expected payoffs for quiet versus send, sending only comes out worse once the credence is above roughly one half, so I'm going with cooperate and pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm looking at a twin prisoner's dilemma where each copy gets different observations. Under A-FDT, the other copy runs the same function on its own input, so its action depends on its own node, not mine. Intervening on my node leaves the other node at its prior value, and that's the crux, though the essay's rule about edges from F to Z still needs checking.\n\nI'm weighing a mixture over whether the two copies' computations coincide, and I'd put that fairly high since the setup is symmetric. Working through the expected payoffs for quiet versus send, sending only comes out worse once the credence is above roughly one half, so I'm going with cooperate and pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8889,"completion_tokens":932,"total_tokens":9821,"cost":0.054196,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.054196,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.035556,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01864},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":471,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}